    "missing": [
      {
        "what": "Per-layer test accuracies for raw versus SAE-encoded representations. They are shown only in a figure absent from the text.",
        "locator": "Results — Test accuracy (figure)",
        "versions": "V5"
      }
    ],
    "verdict_notes": "Commenters (not the article's results) attribute the gap to very low L0 in the early-layer SAEs, e.g. 2 active features at layer 2, and to the SAEs being trained off-distribution. That means the result may reflect SAE quality rather than the representation. The reconstruction rows could arguably bear on V5 completeness, but the author treats them as a sanity check that matched the SAE authors' MSE, so they are left unlinked."
  },
